data: {"id": "7dccb0fa1d80415b-thinking-layer-207", "run_id": "7dccb0fa1d80415b", "node": "layer", "node_name": "问题定位", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "该 Pod 处于 `CrashLoopBackOff` 状态，通常意味着容器启动后崩溃退出，导致 kubelet 不断重启它。为了确定具体原因（例如是否因 OOM 被杀、配置错误或启动命令失败），我需要参考相关的诊断手册。\n\n根据异常类型 `CrashLoopBackOff`，我将获取 `pod-crashloop-runtime.md` 和 `pod-oomkilled.md` 两个 Runbook 以进行排查。\n\n", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 3, "ts_ms": 1788457419330}

